    "rating": 4.2,
    "reference": "ChIJi1Puc0dIyUwRKc-m8ptyDEQ",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Kate-Lynn Clark",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102049527753274276604/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIc51WQKVOmY8NYHh3tp0WRagLROIJPhi-bX5ad2uqF_zomgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "We recently had a few windows replaced. At first the admistration seemed attentive, but when my windows arrived and ready to install, they were not the coloured we had discussed. We had ordered black windows and they installed white ones. Upon studying our receipt further, the pvc had no mentioned colour, but there was noire written on the contract, and so we had thought we had communicated the colour, but it turns out that was in reference to some minute spacer between the panes. This is really misleading and lead to getting windows we don’t actually want, and now we’ve spent a lot of money on. Clearly our colour preference was missed, and while we should have double checked, so should they. At least write the colour of the pvc on the quote even if default is white. We’ve told our sales lady our dissatisfaction and it was brushed off. We now need two more windows to match, but we’re not going back here. These windows arrived later than promised, poor communication when we asked about the delay, and were not what we ordered.",
        "time": 1769283751,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maureen DeCelles",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115295521851133184127/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUGHN-x0E3lXe-FR5nkcjfrOfGwe0wa1FhVQo5N11D_AM2lBM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Our front door window broke July 15,2025. They did not send a person to measure and quote until August 15. We were promised delivery September and signed a contract. It is now November 6 we have only received excuses for the delays. We have been told by another competitor that due to non payment of suppliers they are no longer being shipped. This isn’t going to happen. We have been strung along since August. We are annoyed that we have been lied to and they wasted our time. Buyer beware.",
        "time": 1762430215,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mony Mandel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111543724785566837139/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXwhidO6N-59XGtCio0gnX-UQk2mh6StHEFlPRUmnxpKDpqj5xpvQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Filled out the form on their web site to request a quote to replace a broken window beside my front door. After a week without a response, I called them and they acknowledged receiving my e-mail (but didn't bother responding). The person on the phone said a technician was in the area and would come by that day to take measurements, but they never bothered and didn't even have the courtesy to call and re-schedule. Not the type of company I would want to do business with.",
        "time": 1737119589,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eric",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104498424660183582615/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVfAMhkiOnsCmrkmQYYliG72TJXSSx1gvKNA-dw3Rk7fzDhOU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "From shopping, to advice until the time of installation, simply an incredible experience.\n\nThe two man crew installing our new patio door, Peter and Mike were courteous, professional and perfectionists. The job was done better than the original. You can’t even tell anyone was here to install a Patio door.\n\nPerfect clean up job and they even closed the fence and locked it before leaving.\n\nIf you need a new door or windows, I highly recommend you come here, you won’t regret it.",
        "time": 1713294214,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Patsie Arrowsmith",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109103985272300787888/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKkp07pWAaGR2GcjfqJLk64NP_T8IJyfFY045vmG9FWgv1B5JTC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Had our basement windows replaced by Dicaire a week ago and was very pleased with the entire experience,the quality of the windows and especially the professionalism of the sales staff(Gilles ) and the installers (Peter and Mike) .\nThe work of the Dicaire team was praiseworthy.",
        "time": 1699287908,
        "translated": false
      }
